false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1794700000000, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "v8-0035", "type": "text", "x": 2617.5, "y": 3278.0, "width": 317.93, "height": 21.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1252, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 16276, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1794700000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "DESPLIEGUE CONTINUO (fuera de AWS)", "originalText": "DESPLIEGUE CONTINUO (fuera de AWS)", "fontSize": 17.0, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "v8-0036", "type": "text", "x": -625.0, "y": -780.0, "width": 764.1081081081081, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1259, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 541082921, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795551905326, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "StreamNote · Arquitectura en AWS (v10)", "originalText": "StreamNote · Arquitectura en AWS (v10)", "fontSize": 42.0, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "v8-0037", "type": "rectangle", "x": -625.0, "y": -700.0, "width": 1057.31, "height": 613.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1266, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 1425471052, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795131903698, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "v8-0038", "type": "text", "x": -600.0, "y": -680.0, "width": 1002.31, "height": 573.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1273, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 231802174, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795131903698, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Cambios captados de la retroalimentación:\n- Desorganización entre conexiones (principalmente con lambdas).\n- Poca legibilidad sobre cómo interactúan algunos servicios.\n\nQué cambia en esta versión:\n- Las 6 Lambdas se dibujan una sola vez: Lambda es regional y no se elige su zona.\n  Las zonas A y B quedan solo donde existen: las subredes privadas de Aurora.\n- Cada fila de SQS llega a la Lambda que la procesa: Streaming (media-jobs),\n  Notas (note-writes) y Notificaciones (domain-events).\n- Un evento se puede seguir de punta a punta: Lambda → EventBridge → regla →\n  fila → Notificaciones → DynamoDB. Los recordatorios pasan por Scheduler.\n- CloudFront, WAF e IAM están fuera de la región (son globales);\n  CloudWatch, SNS y el estado de Terraform están dentro.\n- Cada color de flecha tiene su leyenda.\n\nv9: el inicio de sesión con Cognito ya está activo (PR #34).\nv10: las copias se guardan 7 días en dev (2 años en prod).", "originalText": "Cambios captados de la retroalimentación:\n- Desorganización entre conexiones (principalmente con lambdas).\n- Poca legibilidad sobre cómo interactúan algunos servicios.\n\nQué cambia en esta versión:\n- Las 6 Lambdas se dibujan una sola vez: Lambda es regional y no se elige su zona.\n  Las zonas A y B quedan solo donde existen: las subredes privadas de Aurora.\n- Cada fila de SQS llega a la Lambda que la procesa: Streaming (media-jobs),\n  Notas (note-writes) y Notificaciones (domain-events).\n- Un evento se puede seguir de punta a punta: Lambda → EventBridge → regla →\n  fila → Notificaciones → DynamoDB. Los recordatorios pasan por Scheduler.\n- CloudFront, WAF e IAM están fuera de la región (son globales);\n  CloudWatch, SNS y el estado de Terraform están dentro.\n- Cada color de flecha tiene su leyenda.\n\nv9: el inicio de sesión con Cognito ya está activo (PR #34).\nv10: las copias se guardan 7 días en dev (2 años en prod).", "fontSize": 27.0, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "v8-0039", "type": "rectangle", "x": 532.31, "y": -700.0, "width": 1677.12, "height": 535.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1280, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 16640, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1794700000000, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "v8-0040", "type": "text", "x": 557.31, "y": -682.0, "width": 258.38, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1287, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 16731, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1794700000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Leyenda de flechas", "originalText": "Leyenda de flechas", "fontSize": 30.0, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "v8-0041", "type": "text", "x": 4675.0, "y": -700.0, "width": 119.64, "height": 33.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1294, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 16822, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1794700000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Etiquetas:", "originalText": "Etiquetas:", "fontSize": 27.0, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "v8-0042", "type": "rectangle", "x": 4675.0, "y": -635.0, "width": 125.0, "height": 125.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["etq01"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1301, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 16913, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1794700000000, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "v8-0043", "type": "text", "x": 4722.5, "y": -604.0, "width": 30.0, "height": 62.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["etq01"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1308, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 17004, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1794700000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1", "originalText": "1", "fontSize": 50.0, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "v8-0044", "type": "rectangle", "x": 4830.0, "y": -645.0, "width": 780.0, "height": 145.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["etq01"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1315, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 17095, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1794700000000, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "v8-0045", "type": "text", "x": 4847.5, "y": -623.12, "width"